BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Today: Turn towards the small stuff
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20261002T073000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20261002T074000
DTSTAMP:20261008T030000Z
UID:tch-partner-monthly-he-2026-10-02@tchworks.co.uk
DESCRIPTION:TODAY: Today\, every time he points something out (a headline
 \, a dog in the street\, a message from a friend) stop and respond properl
 y. Look up\, put the phone face down\, ask one question about it.\n\nWHY I
 T WORKS: Relationship researchers call these 'bids for connection'. In a w
 ell-known study of newlyweds\, couples still together six years later had 
 turned towards each other's small bids far more often than couples who spl
 it.\n\nWeek 1: Notice\n\nTCH Works · Better Partner Plan. Everyday relati
 onship ideas\, not therapy or counselling. If things feel unsafe or overwh
 elming\, talk to your GP or a relationship counselling service. In an emer
 gency call 999.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://www.tchworks.co.uk/planners/u/890672b37112b894/
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Today: Turn towards the small stuff
TRIGGER:P0D
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Today: The first five minutes
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20261003T073000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20261003T074000
DTSTAMP:20261008T030000Z
UID:tch-partner-monthly-he-2026-10-03@tchworks.co.uk
DESCRIPTION:TODAY: When you next see him today\, give the first five minut
 es to him\, not to logistics. Greet him properly\, ask how the day went\, 
 listen. Who's picking up whom and what's for tea can wait five minutes.\n
 \nWHY IT WORKS: Reunions set the tone for the evening. A warm one costs no
 thing and is easy to make a habit.\n\nWeek 1: Notice\n\nTCH Works · Bette
 r Partner Plan. Everyday relationship ideas\, not therapy or counselling. 
 If things feel unsafe or overwhelming\, talk to your GP or a relationship 
 counselling service. In an emergency call 999.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://www.tchworks.co.uk/planners/u/890672b37112b894/
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Today: The first five minutes
TRIGGER:P0D
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Today: Do one thing from his list
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20261004T073000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20261004T074000
DTSTAMP:20261008T030000Z
UID:tch-partner-monthly-he-2026-10-04@tchworks.co.uk
DESCRIPTION:TODAY: Find one job that has been sitting on his to-do list (t
 he dentist booking\, the parcel return\, the form for school) and do it\, 
 start to finish\, without being asked. Tell him once it's done\, not befor
 e.\n\nWHY IT WORKS: Taking a whole task off someone's plate is worth more 
 than offering to 'help with' it.\n\nWeek 1: Notice\n\nTCH Works · Better 
 Partner Plan. Everyday relationship ideas\, not therapy or counselling. If
  things feel unsafe or overwhelming\, talk to your GP or a relationship co
 unselling service. In an emergency call 999.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://www.tchworks.co.uk/planners/u/890672b37112b894/
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Today: Do one thing from his list
TRIGGER:P0D
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Today: Ask about the thing
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20261005T073000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20261005T074000
DTSTAMP:20261008T030000Z
UID:tch-partner-monthly-he-2026-10-05@tchworks.co.uk
DESCRIPTION:TODAY: Think back to something he mentioned earlier this week:
  a meeting\, a worry\, a friend's news. Ask how it went\, using the detail
 . 'How did the meeting with Sam go? Did they go for the new rota?'\n\nWHY 
 IT WORKS: Remembering the detail tells him that what he says sticks with y
 ou.\n\nWeek 1: Notice\n\nTCH Works · Better Partner Plan. Everyday relati
 onship ideas\, not therapy or counselling. If things feel unsafe or overwh
 elming\, talk to your GP or a relationship counselling service. In an emer
 gency call 999.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://www.tchworks.co.uk/planners/u/890672b37112b894/
