BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Today: Say what you admire
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20261011T073000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20261011T074000
DTSTAMP:20261008T030000Z
UID:tch-partner-monthly-he-2026-10-11@tchworks.co.uk
DESCRIPTION:TODAY: Tell him one quality you admire that has nothing to do 
 with what he does for you. 'I love how patient you are with your mum when 
 she's anxious.' 'You're the funniest person in any room.'\n\nWHY IT WORKS:
  Appreciating who someone is\, not just what they do\, builds a sense of b
 eing seen.\n\nWeek 2: Say it out loud\n\nTCH Works · Better Partner Plan.
  Everyday relationship ideas\, not therapy or counselling. If things feel 
 unsafe or overwhelming\, talk to your GP or a relationship counselling ser
 vice. In an emergency call 999.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://www.tchworks.co.uk/planners/u/890672b37112b894/
