BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Today: Ask for his advice
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20261012T073000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20261012T074000
DTSTAMP:20261008T030000Z
UID:tch-partner-monthly-he-2026-10-12@tchworks.co.uk
DESCRIPTION:TODAY: Ask his opinion on something real you're deciding: work
 \, a purchase\, how to handle a friend. Listen properly. If you don't take
  the advice\, explain why.\n\nWHY IT WORKS: Asking for advice is a quiet f
 orm of respect. It says 'I trust your judgement'.\n\nWeek 2: Say it out lo
 ud\n\nTCH Works · Better Partner Plan. Everyday relationship ideas\, not 
 therapy or counselling. If things feel unsafe or overwhelming\, talk to yo
 ur GP or a relationship counselling service. In an emergency call 999.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://www.tchworks.co.uk/planners/u/890672b37112b894/
