BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Today: The 'I remember' message
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20261013T073000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20261013T074000
DTSTAMP:20261008T030000Z
UID:tch-partner-monthly-he-2026-10-13@tchworks.co.uk
DESCRIPTION:TODAY: Send him a message about a specific happy memory of the
  two of you. 'I was just thinking about that tiny café in Whitby when the
  rain came in sideways.'\n\nWHY IT WORKS: Going back over good shared memo
 ries together is linked to feeling closer. It also tends to start a nice c
 onversation later.\n\nWeek 2: Say it out loud\n\nTCH Works · Better Partn
 er Plan. Everyday relationship ideas\, not therapy or counselling. If thin
 gs feel unsafe or overwhelming\, talk to your GP or a relationship counsel
 ling service. In an emergency call 999.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://www.tchworks.co.uk/planners/u/890672b37112b894/
