SUMMARY:Today: Second check-in
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20261014T073000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20261014T074000
DTSTAMP:20261008T030000Z
UID:tch-partner-monthly-he-2026-10-14@tchworks.co.uk
DESCRIPTION:TODAY: Same 15 minutes as last week. Ask: 'What's been the bes
 t bit of this week for you?' and 'Is there anything you need from me next 
 week?' Listen\, thank him\, pick one thing.\n\nWHY IT WORKS: Doing it a se
 cond time is what turns it into a habit rather than a one-off.\n\nWeek 2: 
 Say it out loud\n\nTCH Works · Better Partner Plan. Everyday relationship
  ideas\, not therapy or counselling. If things feel unsafe or overwhelming
 \, talk to your GP or a relationship counselling service. In an emergency 
 call 999.
