BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Today: Own a whole job
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20261015T073000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20261015T074000
DTSTAMP:20261008T030000Z
UID:tch-partner-monthly-he-2026-10-15@tchworks.co.uk
DESCRIPTION:TODAY: Choose one recurring household job and take it over com
 pletely: the noticing\, planning and doing. Bins\, packed lunches\, the sc
 hool WhatsApp\, birthday presents for your side of the family. Tell him to
 day: 'That's mine now. You don't need to think about it again.'\n\nWHY IT 
 WORKS: A lot of household strain comes from the 'mental load': remembering
 \, planning and checking\, not just doing. Owning a job entirely removes i
 t from his head\, not just his hands.\n\nWeek 3: Lighten the load\n\nTCH W
 orks · Better Partner Plan. Everyday relationship ideas\, not therapy or 
 counselling. If things feel unsafe or overwhelming\, talk to your GP or a 
 relationship counselling service. In an emergency call 999.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://www.tchworks.co.uk/planners/u/890672b37112b894/
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Today: Own a whole job
TRIGGER:P0D
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Today: Notice before you're asked
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20261016T073000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20261016T074000
DTSTAMP:20261008T030000Z
UID:tch-partner-monthly-he-2026-10-16@tchworks.co.uk
DESCRIPTION:TODAY: Today\, find three things that need doing that you'd no
 rmally wait to be told about (the full bin\, the empty loo roll\, the wash
 ing in the machine). Do them. Don't mention it.\n\nWHY IT WORKS: Being the
  person who notices is part of the work. It's often the part that goes uns
 een.\n\nWeek 3: Lighten the load\n\nTCH Works · Better Partner Plan. Ever
 yday relationship ideas\, not therapy or counselling. If things feel unsaf
 e or overwhelming\, talk to your GP or a relationship counselling service.
  In an emergency call 999.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://www.tchworks.co.uk/planners/u/890672b37112b894/
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Today: Notice before you're asked
TRIGGER:P0D
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Today: Clear the evening
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20261017T073000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20261017T074000
DTSTAMP:20261008T030000Z
UID:tch-partner-monthly-he-2026-10-17@tchworks.co.uk
DESCRIPTION:TODAY: Tell him this morning that tonight is covered: you're d
 oing tea\, the washing up and anything else that comes up after 7pm. Then 
 do it\, without commentary.\n\nWHY IT WORKS: Knowing in the morning that t
 he evening is free gives him something to look forward to all day.\n\nWeek
  3: Lighten the load\n\nTCH Works · Better Partner Plan. Everyday relatio
 nship ideas\, not therapy or counselling. If things feel unsafe or overwhe
 lming\, talk to your GP or a relationship counselling service. In an emerg
 ency call 999.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://www.tchworks.co.uk/planners/u/890672b37112b894/
