BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Today: Plan the week's meals
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20261018T073000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20261018T074000
DTSTAMP:20261008T030000Z
UID:tch-partner-monthly-he-2026-10-18@tchworks.co.uk
DESCRIPTION:TODAY: Spend ten minutes planning this week's evening meals an
 d write the shopping list. Then do the shop\, or book the delivery.\n\nWHY
  IT WORKS: 'What are we having for tea?' is one of the most repeated decis
 ions in any home. Taking it away for a week is a real gift.\n\nWeek 3: Lig
 hten the load\n\nTCH Works · Better Partner Plan. Everyday relationship i
 deas\, not therapy or counselling. If things feel unsafe or overwhelming\,
  talk to your GP or a relationship counselling service. In an emergency ca
 ll 999.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
