SUMMARY:Today: Book the thing
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20261019T073000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20261019T074000
DTSTAMP:20261008T030000Z
UID:tch-partner-monthly-he-2026-10-19@tchworks.co.uk
DESCRIPTION:TODAY: There's an appointment or booking that keeps getting pu
 t off: the MOT\, the boiler service\, the haircut\, the vet. Book it today
  and put it in both your calendars.\n\nWHY IT WORKS: Unfinished admin take
 s up head space even when nobody's doing it.\n\nWeek 3: Lighten the load\n
 \nTCH Works · Better Partner Plan. Everyday relationship ideas\, not ther
 apy or counselling. If things feel unsafe or overwhelming\, talk to your G
 P or a relationship counselling service. In an emergency call 999.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://www.tchworks.co.uk/planners/u/890672b37112b894/
