DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20261021T074000
DTSTAMP:20261008T030000Z
UID:tch-partner-monthly-he-2026-10-21@tchworks.co.uk
DESCRIPTION:TODAY: Ask: 'Is there anything you're carrying at the moment t
 hat I don't see?' Write down the answer. Pick one thing to take on and tel
 l him which.\n\nWHY IT WORKS: Asking directly is the fastest way to find t
 he invisible jobs.\n\nWeek 3: Lighten the load\n\nTCH Works · Better Part
 ner Plan. Everyday relationship ideas\, not therapy or counselling. If thi
 ngs feel unsafe or overwhelming\, talk to your GP or a relationship counse
 lling service. In an emergency call 999.
