BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Today: Phones away for one meal
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20261022T073000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20261022T074000
DTSTAMP:20261008T030000Z
UID:tch-partner-monthly-he-2026-10-22@tchworks.co.uk
DESCRIPTION:TODAY: At one meal today\, both phones go in another room. If 
 it feels awkward\, ask: 'What's been the best and worst bit of your day?'
 \n\nWHY IT WORKS: Even having a phone on the table can make a conversation
  feel less close. Removing it is the simplest upgrade there is.\n\nWeek 4:
  Time and attention\n\nTCH Works · Better Partner Plan. Everyday relation
 ship ideas\, not therapy or counselling. If things feel unsafe or overwhel
 ming\, talk to your GP or a relationship counselling service. In an emerge
 ncy call 999.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
