BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Today: Ten minutes\, not about logistics
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20261023T073000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20261023T074000
DTSTAMP:20261008T030000Z
UID:tch-partner-monthly-he-2026-10-23@tchworks.co.uk
DESCRIPTION:TODAY: Find ten minutes today to talk about anything except th
 e kids\, the house\, work admin or money. Try: 'What's on your mind lately
  that we haven't talked about?'\n\nWHY IT WORKS: Couples with busy lives c
 an go weeks talking only about logistics. Ten minutes of real conversation
  keeps you friends\, not just co-managers.\n\nWeek 4: Time and attention\n
 \nTCH Works · Better Partner Plan. Everyday relationship ideas\, not ther
 apy or counselling. If things feel unsafe or overwhelming\, talk to your G
 P or a relationship counselling service. In an emergency call 999.
