BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Today: Plan a date\, all of it
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20261024T073000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20261024T074000
DTSTAMP:20261008T030000Z
UID:tch-partner-monthly-he-2026-10-24@tchworks.co.uk
DESCRIPTION:TODAY: Plan a date in the next fortnight and organise every pa
 rt: when\, where\, the booking and the childcare or dog-sitting. Then tell
  him the time to be ready. It doesn't need to cost much. A walk and chips 
 counts.\n\nWHY IT WORKS: The planning is the gift. Being asked 'what do yo
 u want to do?' can feel like one more job.\n\nWeek 4: Time and attention\n
 \nTCH Works · Better Partner Plan. Everyday relationship ideas\, not ther
 apy or counselling. If things feel unsafe or overwhelming\, talk to your G
 P or a relationship counselling service. In an emergency call 999.
