DTSTAMP:20261008T030000Z
UID:tch-partner-monthly-he-2026-10-25@tchworks.co.uk
DESCRIPTION:TODAY: Suggest a 20-minute walk today\, just the two of you. S
 ide by side\, no destination needed.\n\nWHY IT WORKS: Walking side by side
  often makes conversation easier than sitting face to face.\n\nWeek 4: Tim
 e and attention\n\nTCH Works · Better Partner Plan. Everyday relationship
  ideas\, not therapy or counselling. If things feel unsafe or overwhelming
 \, talk to your GP or a relationship counselling service. In an emergency 
 call 999.
