DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20261026T074000
DTSTAMP:20261008T030000Z
UID:tch-partner-monthly-he-2026-10-26@tchworks.co.uk
DESCRIPTION:TODAY: Next time you hug him today\, don't be the first to let
  go.\n\nWHY IT WORKS: Unhurried physical affection is a simple\, low-effor
 t way to feel close. It's easy to make this a daily habit.\n\nWeek 4: Time
  and attention\n\nTCH Works · Better Partner Plan. Everyday relationship 
 ideas\, not therapy or counselling. If things feel unsafe or overwhelming
 \, talk to your GP or a relationship counselling service. In an emergency 
 call 999.
