BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Today: Ask a better question
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20261027T073000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20261027T074000
DTSTAMP:20261008T030000Z
UID:tch-partner-monthly-he-2026-10-27@tchworks.co.uk
DESCRIPTION:TODAY: Instead of 'How was your day?'\, ask one of these: 'Wha
 t made you laugh today?'\, 'What's the thing you're most looking forward t
 o this week?'\, 'What was the most annoying thing today?' Then ask one fol
 low-up question.\n\nWHY IT WORKS: Specific questions get real answers. Gen
 eric ones get 'fine'.\n\nWeek 4: Time and attention\n\nTCH Works · Better
  Partner Plan. Everyday relationship ideas\, not therapy or counselling. I
 f things feel unsafe or overwhelming\, talk to your GP or a relationship c
 ounselling service. In an emergency call 999.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
