BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Today: Fourth check-in
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20261028T073000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20261028T074000
DTSTAMP:20261008T030000Z
UID:tch-partner-monthly-he-2026-10-28@tchworks.co.uk
DESCRIPTION:TODAY: Ask: 'When did you feel most looked after by me this mo
 nth?' Then: 'What's one thing I could do more of?' Write the answers in yo
 ur phone.\n\nWHY IT WORKS: The answers are your best guide to what actuall
 y lands for him.\n\nWeek 4: Time and attention\n\nTCH Works · Better Part
 ner Plan. Everyday relationship ideas\, not therapy or counselling. If thi
 ngs feel unsafe or overwhelming\, talk to your GP or a relationship counse
 lling service. In an emergency call 999.
