BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Today: Something you don't know yet
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20261029T073000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20261029T074000
DTSTAMP:20261008T030000Z
UID:tch-partner-monthly-he-2026-10-29@tchworks.co.uk
DESCRIPTION:TODAY: Ask him one of these today and really listen: 'What did
  you want to be when you were ten?'\, 'What's a smell that takes you strai
 ght back to childhood?'\, 'What's the best piece of advice you've ever bee
 n given?'\n\nWHY IT WORKS: However long you've been together\, there's alw
 ays more to find out. Curiosity is a sign of interest\, and people feel it
 .\n\nWeek 5: Be curious\n\nTCH Works · Better Partner Plan. Everyday rela
 tionship ideas\, not therapy or counselling. If things feel unsafe or over
 whelming\, talk to your GP or a relationship counselling service. In an em
 ergency call 999.
