SUMMARY:Today: Ask about his friends
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20261030T073000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20261030T074000
DTSTAMP:20261008T030000Z
UID:tch-partner-monthly-he-2026-10-30@tchworks.co.uk
DESCRIPTION:TODAY: Ask about one of his friends by name: how they're doing
 \, what's going on in their life. Remember the answer for next time.\n\nWH
 Y IT WORKS: Caring about the people who matter to him is a way of caring a
 bout him.\n\nWeek 5: Be curious\n\nTCH Works · Better Partner Plan. Every
 day relationship ideas\, not therapy or counselling. If things feel unsafe
  or overwhelming\, talk to your GP or a relationship counselling service. 
 In an emergency call 999.
