BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Today: The 'one year off' question
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20261031T073000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20261031T074000
DTSTAMP:20261008T030000Z
UID:tch-partner-monthly-he-2026-10-31@tchworks.co.uk
DESCRIPTION:TODAY: Ask: 'If money and time didn't matter for one year\, wh
 at would you do with it?' Ask why. Don't point out why it's impractical.\n
 \nWHY IT WORKS: Knowing someone's hopes\, even unrealistic ones\, is part 
 of knowing them well.\n\nWeek 5: Be curious\n\nTCH Works · Better Partner
  Plan. Everyday relationship ideas\, not therapy or counselling. If things
  feel unsafe or overwhelming\, talk to your GP or a relationship counselli
 ng service. In an emergency call 999.
