DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20261101T074000
DTSTAMP:20261008T030000Z
UID:tch-partner-monthly-he-2026-11-01@tchworks.co.uk
DESCRIPTION:TODAY: On a cold morning or evening\, do the small warming job
  before he needs it: scrape the car windscreen\, put the heating on early
 \, or put a hot water bottle in his side of the bed.\n\nWHY IT WORKS: Bein
 g thought of before you ask is one of the most noticed kinds of care.\n\nN
 ovember pack\n\nTCH Works · Better Partner Plan. Everyday relationship id
 eas\, not therapy or counselling. If things feel unsafe or overwhelming\, 
 talk to your GP or a relationship counselling service. In an emergency cal
 l 999.
