UID:tch-partner-monthly-he-2026-11-02@tchworks.co.uk
DESCRIPTION:TODAY: Tonight\, ask: 'What's the one thing this week you're d
 reading\, and the one you're looking forward to?' Offer to help with the f
 irst.\n\nWHY IT WORKS: Knowing what's coming lets you help at the right mo
 ment\, not after.\n\nNovember pack\n\nTCH Works · Better Partner Plan. Ev
 eryday relationship ideas\, not therapy or counselling. If things feel uns
 afe or overwhelming\, talk to your GP or a relationship counselling servic
 e. In an emergency call 999.
