  reminder a week before: a check-up\, an interview\, a friend's birthday. 
 Ask about it on the day.\n\nWHY IT WORKS: Following up on what matters to 
 someone shows it stuck.\n\nNovember pack\n\nTCH Works · Better Partner Pl
 an. Everyday relationship ideas\, not therapy or counselling. If things fe
 el unsafe or overwhelming\, talk to your GP or a relationship counselling 
