UID:tch-partner-monthly-he-2026-11-06@tchworks.co.uk
DESCRIPTION:TODAY: Tell him one specific thing you're proud of him for thi
 s year. 'I'm proud of how you handled the job change.'\n\nWHY IT WORKS: Pr
 ide is different from praise. It says you see effort over time.\n\nNovembe
 r pack\n\nTCH Works · Better Partner Plan. Everyday relationship ideas\, 
 not therapy or counselling. If things feel unsafe or overwhelming\, talk t
 o your GP or a relationship counselling service. In an emergency call 999.
